Eulobus is a genus of flowering plants belonging to the family Onagraceae.

Its native range is Southwestern USA to Northwestern Mexico.

Species:

Eulobus angelorum {{small|(S.Watson) W.L.Wagner & Hoch}}
Eulobus californicus {{small|Nutt.}}
Eulobus crassifolius {{small|(Greene) W.L.Wagner & Hoch}}
Eulobus sceptrostigma {{small|(Brandegee) W.L.Wagner & Hoch}}
